<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.1">
<l>tukkac cuḻalaiyaic cūḻntu kiṭanta valaiyai yaṟappaṟittu</l>
<l>pukkiṉil pukkuṉṉaik kaṇṭukoṇ ṭēṉiṉip pōka viṭuvatuṇṭē</l>
<l>makka ḷaṟuvaraik kalliṭai mōta viḻantavaḷ taṉvayiṟṟil</l>
<l>cikkeṉa vantu piṟantuniṉ ṟāytiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Plucking at [the strings of this] net</l>
<l rend="indent">that lays surrounded by vessels of suffering</l>
<l>in order to sever [it],</l>
<l rend="indent">having entered the sweet abode [that you had] entered,</l>
<l>and having seen you, I understand.</l>
<l rend="indent">How can [I] let [you] go now?</l>
<l>You who quickly came and were born in the womb of her</l>
<l rend="indent">who lost six children when [they were] dashed between stones!</l>
<l>My Father of Tirumāliruñcōlai!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
